hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2826","###\n Narrated to us Muhammad bin Yahya, who said: Narrated to us Abdullah bin Muhammad al-Nufayli, who said: Narrated to us Hatim, who said: Narrated to us Ja'far, from his father, who said: We entered upon Jabir (RA). I said, \Inform me about the Hajj of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ).\"" He mentioned part of the narration and said: \""He rode his she-camel"," Al-Qaswa'"," until he reached the place of standing (Arafat)."""
